description:
The creation of a multi-facility sports hub at The Cloughan, Doagh Road, Ballyclare. This includes:
-The construction of a 3G multi-sports pitch with perimeter fence and floodlights;
-construction of an artificial hockey pitch (on an existing gravel surface) with perimeter fence and floodlight refurbishment;
-the upgrade of the existing cricket square, outfield, and associated equipment(covers, sightscreens, etc.);
-and the improvement of grass rugby pitches including drainage and floodlighting.
In additional, all landscaping, infrastructure, planning and design works associated with the above works are included in the scope of work. The works are expected to be completed in a phased manner, so the management of construction within an active sports hub is vital.
